## Vortexsoft Admin Panel — .htaccess
## Restricts admin panel access to the .com domain only.
## If someone visits /admin/* from the .in domain, they are
## permanently redirected to the same path on the .com domain.

<IfModule mod_rewrite.c>
    RewriteEngine On

    # Redirect .in domain admin access → .com domain
    RewriteCond %{HTTP_HOST} \.in$ [NC]
    RewriteRule ^(.*)$ https://www.vortexsoftinnovations.com/admin/$1 [R=301,L]
</IfModule>
